message: >-
  Human System is one author's evolving body of thought, not a peer-reviewed or
  formally published work. If you refer to it, please cite this repository at
  the commit or date you consulted. Individual papers may acquire their own
  citation identities later.
title: "Human System"
abstract: >-
  A working body of thought about understanding and intervening responsibly in
  human systems when the right action depends on context, together with the
  repository tooling that supports its development.
